               >OJ L 88, 4.4.2011, p. 45</a>).</p>
         <p class="oj-note">
            <a id="ntr10-L_2016119EN.01000101-E0010" href="#ntc10-L_2016119EN.01000101-E0010"
               >(<span class="oj-super">10</span>)</a>  Council Directive 93/13/EEC of 5 April 1993 on unfair terms in consumer contracts (<a href="./../../../../legal-content/EN/AUTO/?uri=OJ:L:1993:095:TOC"
